  m_text: '<b>Mrs. Y</b>, 78


    Mrs. Y became tearful during morning care. She
    says the tone of one of your colleagues frightens her.


    <b><color=#C47A14>Watch
    out:</color></b> Make her feel safe without speaking badly about your colleague.'
