  m_text: '<b>Mr. X</b>, 51


    Mr. X has a leg infection that needs intravenous
    antibiotics for a few more days. Today is his granddaughter''s birthday, and
    he refuses physical therapy and mobilization.


    <b><color=#3D8D3F>Watch out:</color></b>
    Acknowledge his disappointment without making promises about his discharge.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
