  m_text: '<b>Ms. Z</b>, 34


    The physician ordered an urgent blood transfusion
    because her hemoglobin is dropping. She pushes the IV set away and threatens
    to sue the hospital.


    <b><color=#AF2925>Watch out:</color></b> Respect her
    right to refuse while keeping her safe and involving the physician.'
